# Agent instructions

- `packages/python/` implements the M1 Python runner and `packages/tasknest/` implements the TypeScript runner.
- Install dependencies with Pixi and run `pixi run tools run check` and `pixi run tools run test`.
- Edit `templates/README.md.j2` or `templates/AGENTS.md.j2`, then run `pixi run tools run docs_write`.
- Repository automation lives in `tools/*.py` and runs directly via Tasknest (`pixi run tools ls`).
- Use `pixi run backlog task list --plain` and review `backlog/docs/` and decisions before changes.
- Do not publish packages, push branches, or mutate offline mirrors without authorization.
- Read `backlog/docs/doc-6 - Pixi-sandbox-offline-setup.md` before claiming offline restore works.
